Bedwyr, I've caught the beast, or at least it shouldn't bother you anymore.
bediwyr: Goodness, you did? What the devil was it, then?
The Questing Beast, the one my father had been hunting his whole life.
bediwyr: Maybe that's what brought you back here.
Viktor: (Bediwyr agreeing to repair Sequence)
bediwyr: I'll meet you at the smithy. I think I saw the other half of it somewhere around there.
The other half of Sequence? Why would you have that?
bediwyr: I don't like throwing things away if they might be useful. Sequence is a special blade.